@startuml
title My Trading Bot - Architecture Overview
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

package "External Services" {
  cloud "Yahoo Finance" as YF
  database "TimescaleDB\n(Docker container)" as TS
  component "Backtrader\n(engine)" as Backtrader
  component "QuantStats\n(report generator)" as Quantstats
}

component "Config Settings\n(config/settings.py)" as Config

package "Market Data Layer" {
  component "MarketData API\n(data/market_data_api.py)" as MarketAPI
  component "Data Loader CLI\n(data/data_handler.py)" as DataCLI
  storage "Live Snapshots\n(Projekt/my_trading_bot/data/live_data/*.csv)" as LiveCSV
  storage "Historic CSVs\n(Projekt/my_trading_bot/data/historical_prices/*.csv)" as HistCSV
}

package "Backtesting Pipeline" {
  component "Backtest Runner\n(backtest_runner.py)" as Runner
  component "Strategy Library\n(strategies/*.py)" as Strategies
  collections "Pickled Returns\n(Projekt/my_trading_bot/results/*.pkl)" as Results
}

package "Dashboard (dashboard/*)" {
  component "Dash App Shell\n(app.py)" as DashApp
  component "Tab Layouts\n(layouts/*)" as Layouts
  component "Tab Callbacks\n(callbacks/tab*_callbacks.py)" as Callbacks
  component "Data Loader & Bootstrap Scheduler\n(data_loader.py)" as DashDataLoader
  component "QuantStats Cache\n(quantstats_cache.py)" as QSCache
  component "Strategy Docs Loader\n(tab3 + docs)" as DocsLoader
}

folder "Strategy Docs\n(Projekt/my_trading_bot/docs/strategy_descriptions/*.md)" as Docs

Config --> Runner : CAPITAL/\nCOMMISSION\nPREDEFINED_SYMBOLS

YF --> MarketAPI : OHLCV\n( yfinance )
MarketAPI --> LiveCSV : save snapshot
MarketAPI --> TS : upsert\nlatest candles
DataCLI --> MarketAPI : reuse fetch/\nnormalize logic

Runner --> MarketAPI : fetch bootstrap data
Runner --> HistCSV : persist\nbacktest input
Runner --> Strategies : instantiate
Strategies --> Backtrader : derived bt.Strategy
Runner --> Backtrader : run Cerebro
Runner --> Results : pickle\nreturns per strategy/symbol

DashApp --> Layouts
DashApp --> Callbacks
Callbacks --> DashDataLoader : load metrics,\nnormalized returns
DashDataLoader --> TS : query OHLCV
DashDataLoader --> HistCSV : fallback read
DashDataLoader --> LiveCSV : fallback & status info
DashDataLoader --> MarketAPI : bootstrap\nnew symbols (threaded)
DashDataLoader --> Results : load\ncumulative returns
Callbacks --> DocsLoader : Tab 3 requests\nmarkdown content
DocsLoader --> Docs : Markdown\nrendered in Tab 3

QSCache --> DashDataLoader : request returns
QSCache --> Results : read pickle data
QSCache --> Quantstats : render HTML\ntearsheets
QSCache --> Callbacks : serve cached\niframe content

note right of DashDataLoader
  - Schedules bootstrap on app startup (schedule_bootstrap)
  - Persists last run to data/live_data/.bootstrap_state.json
  - Falls back to CSVs if TimescaleDB unreachable
end note

note bottom of Results
  Also consumed by dashboard callbacks for Tab 1/2 and cached QuantStats reports.
end note

note top of TS
  TimescaleDB connection configurable via ENV vars (TIMESCALE_URL, TS_TABLE)
end note

@enduml